\texttt{v0-baseline} & Visible Text Only & Yes & Yes & Baseline Control Verified \\
\texttt{v1-jsonld}   & JSON-LD (\texttt{<script>}) & Yes & \textbf{No ($0\%$)} & Pruned by \texttt{DISABLED\_ELEMENTS} \\
